# --- AI workspace / agent architecture (local-only per ADR-010; never pushed to GitHub) ---
# NOTE: CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, GEMINI.md, docs/ai/, and docs/securevault_prompts.md are
# already tracked in local git history (see ADR-010) and are NOT untracked by these entries —
# git ignores .gitignore for paths it already tracks. These patterns exist to (a) stop any
# *new* AI-tooling file from being picked up by a future `git add -A`, and (b) document what
# must be excluded if this repo is ever cloned fresh or these files are untracked later.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
docs/ai/
docs/securevault_prompts.md
.mcp.json
*.session.json
